<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Recipes App: Hannes Nagel</title>
    <meta name="description" content="The Recipes App: collect recipes, organize them, and keep shopping lists in sync across iPhone and the web.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/neon.css">
</head>

<body>
    <div id="site-nav"></div>

    <main class="page">
        <section class="hero rcp-hero">
            <p class="sub-header">iOS + Web App</p>
            <h1>Recipes that <em>stay</em> organized.</h1>
            <p class="lead">Store recipes, sync shopping lists, stop losing scraps of paper.</p>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="https://apps.apple.com/de/app/the-recipes-app/id6745904570" class="nav-link">Get it on the App Store</a>
                <a href="https://recipes.hannesnagel.com" class="nav-link">Open the web app</a>
            </div>

            <div class="kitchen" aria-label="Example recipe and shopping list">
                <div class="recipe-card">
                    <span class="card-tag">Recipe</span>
                    <h3>Weeknight Tomato Pasta</h3>
                    <div class="recipe-meta"><span>25 min</span><span>·</span><span>serves 2</span><span>·</span><span>family favorite</span></div>
                    <ol class="recipe-steps">
                        <li>Boil pasta in well-salted water.</li>
                        <li>Soften garlic in olive oil, add tomatoes.</li>
                        <li>Simmer, season, toss with pasta.</li>
                        <li>Basil on top. Done.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
                <div class="shopping-card">
                    <span class="card-tag" style="color: var(--neon-cyan);">Shopping list</span>
                    <h3>Tap to check off</h3>
                    <ul id="shop-list">
                        <li><span class="box"></span>Spaghetti, 250 g</li>
                        <li><span class="box"></span>Canned tomatoes, 2×</li>
                        <li><span class="box"></span>Garlic, 1 head</li>
                        <li><span class="box"></span>Fresh basil</li>
                        <li><span class="box"></span>Parmesan</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="shopping-hint">In the real app this syncs to your phone as you shop.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work rcp-cards">
            <div class="section-head">
                <p class="sub-header" style="color: var(--neon-magenta);">What it does</p>
                <h2>The <em>useful</em> parts.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="cards">
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3.5V14m0 0l-3.5-3.5M12 14l3.5-3.5"/><path d="M4.5 16.5v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h11a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Import recipes</h3>
                        <p>Type them, photograph them, or paste them. Even grandma's handwriting.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8.5" r="3.2"/><path d="M3.5 19.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="9.5" r="2.4"/><path d="M16.4 14.6a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 4.6 4.4"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Share with others</h3>
                        <p>Share the collection. Let everyone add to it.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9.5" cy="19.5" r="1.4"/><circle cx="17" cy="19.5" r="1.4"/><path d="M3.5 4.5h2L8 15.5h10.5L20.5 7.5H6.2"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Shopping lists</h3>
                        <p>Turn recipes into a shopping list that actually matches the store aisle.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6.5" y="3" width="11" height="18" rx="2.4"/><path d="M10.5 18h3"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Cross-device access</h3>
                        <p>iPhone and web, same list, everywhere.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="footer-cta">
            <p class="sub-header">Hit me up</p>
            <h2>Questions, ideas, or a recipe to brag about?</h2>
            <div class="links">
                <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="/recipes/privacy">Privacy</a>
                <a href="/recipes/terms">Terms</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/components.js"></script>
    <script>
        (function () {
            var list = document.getElementById('shop-list');
            if (!list) { return; }
            var items = list.querySelectorAll('li');
            list.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
                var li = e.target.closest('li');
                if (!li) { return; }
                li.classList.toggle('done');
                var allDone = true;
                items.forEach(function (i) { if (!i.classList.contains('done')) { allDone = false; } });
                if (allDone && window.hnConfetti) {
                    var r = li.getBoundingClientRect();
                    window.hnConfetti(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top, 50);
                }
            });
        })();
    </script>
</body>

</html>
